# @pulse/web environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env.local` to override. Defaults live in `.env.development` (read by
# the dev server) and `.env.production` (read by `vite build`).
#
# Leave a variable commented out rather than setting it empty. An empty string
# is not nullish, so it defeats the `?? "http://localhost:…"` fallback where
# one is read.

# @osn/api, the OIDC issuer
VITE_OSN_ISSUER_URL=http://localhost:4000

# @pulse/api is not set here. The browser reaches it through this origin's own
# `/api` mount, and the server that renders pages reads `PULSE_API_INTERNAL_URL`
# from its process environment at request time (`src/lib/transport.ts`,
# default http://localhost:3001).
